msgstr "Otkriven dodatak za plaćanje"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of detected payment plugin names.
#: admin/class-admin.php:1999
#, php-format
msgid "FAZ Cookie Manager blocks payment provider scripts (PayPal, Stripe, …) until consent, so a payment form in %s can fail with an error like \"paypal is not defined\" until you authorise the provider. If your payment forms are broken, enable the specific gateway under Settings → Script Blocking → Payment gateways (it loads that provider's scripts before consent — your decision and responsibility)."
msgstr "FAZ Cookie Manager blokira skripte pružatelja usluga plaćanja (PayPal, Stripe, …) do davanja privole, pa obrazac za plaćanje u %s može zakazati s pogreškom poput „paypal is not defined“ dok ne odobrite pružatelja usluge. Ako su vaši obrasci za plaćanje neispravni, omogućite odgovarajućeg pružatelja usluge plaćanja pod Postavke → Blokiranje skripti → Pružatelji usluga plaćanja (time se učitavaju skripte tog pružatelja prije privole — to je vaša odluka i odgovornost)."

#: admin/class-admin.php:2002
