msgid ""
"## Cookies used on this site\n"
"\n"
"{{COOKIE_CATEGORIES}}"
msgstr ""
"## Kolačići koji se koriste na ovoj stranici\n"
"\n"
"{{COOKIE_CATEGORIES}}"

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:65
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: gdpr-strict / section-5"
msgid ""
"## Third-party services\n"
"\n"
"Where you give consent, this site may load resources from the following third-party services, which set their own cookies:\n"
"\n"
"{{THIRD_PARTY_SERVICES}}\n"
"\n"
"Each third party is an independent data controller for the cookies it sets; please consult their respective privacy policies."
msgstr ""
"## Usluge trećih strana\n"
"\n"
"Ako date privolu, ova stranica može učitavati resurse sa sljedećih usluga trećih strana, koje postavljaju vlastite kolačiće:\n"
"\n"
"{{THIRD_PARTY_SERVICES}}\n"
"\n"
"Svaka treća strana samostalni je voditelj obrade za kolačiće koje postavlja; molimo pogledajte njihova odgovarajuća pravila o privatnosti."

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:76
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: gdpr-strict / section-6"
msgid ""
"## How long we keep data\n"
"\n"
"Consent records and analytics data are retained for {{RETENTION_PERIOD}} from collection. Strictly necessary cookies are retained only for the duration of the session or as required for the technical function they serve. See the table above for the specific lifetime of each cookie."
msgstr ""
"## Koliko dugo čuvamo podatke\n"
"\n"
"Zapisi o privolama i analitički podaci čuvaju se {{RETENTION_PERIOD}} od prikupljanja. Strogo nužni kolačići čuvaju se samo tijekom trajanja sesije ili onoliko koliko je potrebno za tehničku funkciju kojoj služe. Pogledajte tablicu iznad za točno trajanje svakog kolačića."

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:83
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: gdpr-strict / section-7"
msgid ""
"## Your rights\n"
"\n"
"Under GDPR Art. 12-22 you have the right to:\n"
"\n"
"- access the personal data we hold about you (Art. 15)\n"
"- request rectification of inaccurate data (Art. 16)\n"
"- request erasure (\"right to be forgotten\", Art. 17)\n"
"- restrict processing (Art. 18)\n"
"- data portability (Art. 20)\n"
"- object to processing based on legitimate interest (Art. 21)\n"
"- withdraw consent at any time (Art. 7(3))\n"
"- lodge a complaint with your national supervisory authority\n"
"\n"
"To exercise these rights contact us at **{{COMPANY_EMAIL}}**. We will respond within one month of receipt (GDPR Art. 12(3))."
msgstr ""
"## Vaša prava\n"
"\n"
"Prema čl. 12.-22. GDPR-a imate pravo na:\n"
"\n"
"- pristup osobnim podacima koje čuvamo o vama (čl. 15.)\n"
"- zahtjev za ispravak netočnih podataka (čl. 16.)\n"
"- zahtjev za brisanje („pravo na zaborav“, čl. 17.)\n"
"- ograničenje obrade (čl. 18.)\n"
"- prenosivost podataka (čl. 20.)\n"
"- prigovor na obradu temeljenu na legitimnom interesu (čl. 21.)\n"
"- povlačenje privole u bilo kojem trenutku (čl. 7. st. 3.)\n"
"- podnošenje prigovora nadležnom nacionalnom nadzornom tijelu\n"
"\n"
"Za ostvarivanje ovih prava kontaktirajte nas na **{{COMPANY_EMAIL}}**. Odgovorit ćemo u roku od mjesec dana od primitka zahtjeva (čl. 12. st. 3. GDPR-a)."

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:101
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: gdpr-strict / section-8"
msgid ""
"## Changes to this policy\n"
"\n"
"We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. The \"Last updated\" date at the top reflects the most recent revision. Material changes will trigger a re-consent prompt on your next visit."
msgstr ""
"## Izmjene ovih pravila\n"
"\n"
"Povremeno možemo ažurirati ova Pravila o kolačićima. Datum „Zadnje ažurirano“ na vrhu odražava najnoviju reviziju. Bitne izmjene pokrenut će ponovni zahtjev za privolu prilikom vašeg sljedećeg posjeta."

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:108
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: gdpr-strict / section-9"
msgid ""
"## Contact\n"
"\n"
"For any question about this Cookie Policy, contact us at **{{COMPANY_EMAIL}}**."
msgstr ""
"## Kontakt\n"
"\n"
"Za sva pitanja o ovim Pravilima o kolačićima, kontaktirajte nas na **{{COMPANY_EMAIL}}**."

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:117
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: ccpa-california / introduction"
msgid ""
"# Notice at Collection & Cookie Policy\n"
"\n"
"**Last updated:** {{LAST_UPDATED_DATE}}\n"
"\n"
"This Notice at Collection and Cookie Policy explains how **{{COMPANY_NAME}}** (\"we\", \"us\", \"our\") collects, uses, and shares Personal Information through this website, in compliance with the California Consumer Privacy Act of 2018 as amended by the California Privacy Rights Act (CCPA/CPRA, Cal. Civ. Code §§ 1798.100 et seq.) and the implementing regulations issued by the California Privacy Protection Agency (CPPA)."
msgstr ""
"# Obavijest pri prikupljanju i Pravila o kolačićima\n"
"\n"
"**Zadnje ažurirano:** {{LAST_UPDATED_DATE}}\n"
"\n"
"Ova Obavijest pri prikupljanju i Pravila o kolačićima objašnjavaju kako **{{COMPANY_NAME}}** („mi“, „nas“, „naš“) prikuplja, koristi i dijeli osobne podatke (Personal Information) putem ove internetske stranice, u skladu s Kalifornijskim zakonom o zaštiti privatnosti potrošača iz 2018. godine, izmijenjenim Kalifornijskim zakonom o pravima na privatnost (CCPA/CPRA, Cal. Civ. Code §§ 1798.100 i dalje) te provedbenim propisima koje je izdala Kalifornijska agencija za zaštitu privatnosti (CPPA)."

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:126
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: ccpa-california / section-1"
msgid ""
"## Business contact\n"
"\n"
"- **Business name:** {{COMPANY_NAME}}\n"
"- **Address:** {{COMPANY_ADDRESS}}\n"
"- **Privacy contact email:** {{COMPANY_EMAIL}}\n"
"- **Registration:** {{COMPANY_REGISTRY}}"
msgstr ""
"## Kontakt poslovnog subjekta\n"
"\n"
"- **Naziv poslovnog subjekta:** {{COMPANY_NAME}}\n"
"- **Adresa:** {{COMPANY_ADDRESS}}\n"
"- **E-pošta za pitanja privatnosti:** {{COMPANY_EMAIL}}\n"
"- **Registracija:** {{COMPANY_REGISTRY}}"

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:136
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: ccpa-california / section-2"
msgid ""
"## Categories of Personal Information collected\n"
"\n"
"We collect the following categories of Personal Information as defined under CCPA § 1798.140(v):\n"
"\n"
"- **Identifiers** — IP address (hashed), device identifiers, online identifiers (cookies, beacons)\n"
"- **Internet or other electronic network activity information** — browsing history, search history, interactions with our website\n"
"- **Geolocation data** — approximate location derived from IP (country/region only; not precise GPS)\n"
"- **Inferences** — preferences and characteristics inferred from your interactions, used for site analytics\n"
"\n"
"We do **not** knowingly collect:\n"
"- Sensitive Personal Information (Cal. Civ. Code § 1798.140(ae)) without your explicit opt-in\n"
"- Personal Information of consumers under 16 without affirmative opt-in (children under 13 require parental consent)"
msgstr ""
"## Kategorije prikupljenih osobnih podataka\n"
"\n"
"Prikupljamo sljedeće kategorije osobnih podataka (Personal Information) kako je definirano u CCPA § 1798.140(v):\n"
"\n"
"- **Identifikatori** — IP adresa (hashirana), identifikatori uređaja, mrežni identifikatori (kolačići, beaconi)\n"
"- **Podaci o aktivnosti na internetu ili drugoj elektroničkoj mreži** — povijest pregledavanja, povijest pretraživanja, interakcije s našom internetskom stranicom\n"
"- **Podaci o geolokaciji** — približna lokacija izvedena iz IP adrese (samo država/regija; ne precizni GPS)\n"
"- **Zaključci** — preferencije i karakteristike izvedene iz vaših interakcija, korištene za analitiku stranice\n"
"\n"
"**Ne** prikupljamo svjesno:\n"
"- Osjetljive osobne podatke (Cal. Civ. Code § 1798.140(ae)) bez vaše izričite privole (opt-in)\n"
"- Osobne podatke potrošača mlađih od 16 godina bez potvrdnog opt-in pristanka (djeca mlađa od 13 godina zahtijevaju roditeljsku privolu)"

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:152
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: ccpa-california / section-3"
msgid ""
"## Sources of Personal Information\n"
"\n"
"- Directly from you when you interact with the site (forms, banner choices, account creation)\n"
"- Automatically via cookies and tracking technologies\n"
"- From third-party services where you have authorized data sharing"
msgstr ""
"## Izvori osobnih podataka\n"
"\n"
"- Izravno od vas kada komunicirate sa stranicom (obrasci, izbori u banneru, otvaranje računa)\n"
"- Automatski putem kolačića i tehnologija za praćenje\n"
"- Od usluga trećih strana za koje ste odobrili dijeljenje podataka"

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:161
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: ccpa-california / section-4"
msgid ""
"## Purposes for collecting Personal Information\n"
"\n"
"- Operate and secure the website (necessary business purpose, § 1798.140(e))\n"
"- Audit interactions with the website\n"
"- Short-term, transient use of Personal Information\n"
"- Maintain and improve quality and safety of our service\n"
"- Conduct analytics with your consent\n"
"- Personalize advertising **only with your opt-in consent**"
msgstr ""
"## Svrhe prikupljanja osobnih podataka\n"
"\n"
"- Rad i sigurnost internetske stranice (nužna poslovna svrha, § 1798.140(e))\n"
"- Revizija interakcija s internetskom stranicom\n"
"- Kratkotrajno, prolazno korištenje osobnih podataka\n"
"- Održavanje i poboljšanje kvalitete i sigurnosti naše usluge\n"
"- Provođenje analitike uz vašu privolu\n"
"- Personalizacija oglašavanja **isključivo uz vaš opt-in pristanak**"

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:173
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: ccpa-california / section-5"
msgid ""
"## Cookies used\n"
"\n"
"{{COOKIE_CATEGORIES}}"
msgstr ""
