#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:180
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: ccpa-california / section-6"
msgid ""
"## Third-party recipients\n"
"\n"
"Where you have not opted out, we share Personal Information with the following service providers and contractors (CCPA § 1798.140(j) & (ag)):\n"
"\n"
"{{THIRD_PARTY_SERVICES}}\n"
"\n"
"We **do not sell or share Personal Information** for cross-context behavioral advertising unless you have opted in. To opt out at any time, click the \"Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\" link in the website footer."
msgstr ""
"## Primatelji — treće strane\n"
"\n"
"Ako se niste odjavili (opt-out), dijelimo osobne podatke sa sljedećim pružateljima usluga i ugovarateljima (CCPA § 1798.140(j) i (ag)):\n"
"\n"
"{{THIRD_PARTY_SERVICES}}\n"
"\n"
"**Ne prodajemo niti dijelimo osobne podatke** za međukontekstualno bihevioralno oglašavanje osim ako niste dali privolu (opt-in). Za odjavu (opt-out) u bilo kojem trenutku kliknite poveznicu „Ne prodaj niti dijeli moje osobne podatke“ u podnožju internetske stranice."

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:191
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: ccpa-california / section-7"
msgid ""
"## Retention\n"
"\n"
"Personal Information is retained for {{RETENTION_PERIOD}} from collection, unless a longer period is required by law or for legitimate business purposes (CCPA § 1798.100(a)(3))."
msgstr ""
"## Razdoblje čuvanja\n"
"\n"
"Osobni podaci čuvaju se {{RETENTION_PERIOD}} od prikupljanja, osim ako je zakonom ili u legitimne poslovne svrhe propisano dulje razdoblje (CCPA § 1798.100(a)(3))."

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:198
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: ccpa-california / section-8"
msgid ""
"## Your CCPA/CPRA rights\n"
"\n"
"As a California resident, you have the right to:\n"
"\n"
"- **Right to Know** (§ 1798.100, .110, .115) — request what Personal Information we collect, use, disclose, or sell\n"
"- **Right to Delete** (§ 1798.105) — request deletion of your Personal Information\n"
"- **Right to Correct** (§ 1798.106) — request correction of inaccurate Personal Information\n"
"- **Right to Opt Out of Sale or Sharing** (§ 1798.120) — direct us not to sell or share your Personal Information\n"
"- **Right to Limit Use of Sensitive Personal Information** (§ 1798.121) — limit our use of Sensitive Personal Information to disclosed purposes\n"
"- **Right to Non-Discrimination** (§ 1798.125) — we will not discriminate against you for exercising any of these rights\n"
"- **Right to Data Portability** (§ 1798.130(a)(2)) — receive Personal Information in a readily usable format\n"
"\n"
"To exercise the rights to know, delete, correct or port, email **{{COMPANY_EMAIL}}**. Those are verifiable consumer requests, so we will verify your identity before acting (CCPA § 1798.130(a)(2)), and we will respond within **45 days** (extendable to 90 with notice, § 1798.130(a)(2)(B)).\n"
"\n"
"To opt out of the sale or sharing of your Personal Information, use the \"Do Not Sell or Share\" and \"Manage Preferences\" links in the website footer. To limit our use of Sensitive Personal Information, email **{{COMPANY_EMAIL}}**. Neither an opt-out nor a request to limit is a verifiable consumer request (CPPA Reg. § 7060(b)): we will act on both without asking you to verify your identity or to create an account.\n"
"\n"
"You may also designate an authorized agent to submit a request on your behalf (Cal. Civ. Code § 1798.135(c))."
msgstr ""
"## Vaša prava prema CCPA/CPRA\n"
"\n"
"Kao stanovnik Kalifornije imate pravo:\n"
"\n"
"- **Pravo na uvid** (§ 1798.100, .110, .115) — zatražiti koje osobne podatke prikupljamo, upotrebljavamo, otkrivamo ili prodajemo\n"
"- **Pravo na brisanje** (§ 1798.105) — zatražiti brisanje svojih osobnih podataka\n"
"- **Pravo na ispravak** (§ 1798.106) — zatražiti ispravak netočnih osobnih podataka\n"
"- **Pravo na odbijanje prodaje ili dijeljenja** (§ 1798.120) — naložiti nam da vaše osobne podatke ne prodajemo niti dijelimo\n"
"- **Pravo na ograničenje uporabe osjetljivih osobnih podataka** (§ 1798.121) — ograničiti našu uporabu osjetljivih osobnih podataka na objavljene svrhe\n"
"- **Pravo na nediskriminaciju** (§ 1798.125) — nećemo vas stavljati u nepovoljniji položaj zbog ostvarivanja bilo kojeg od ovih prava\n"
"- **Pravo na prenosivost podataka** (§ 1798.130(a)(2)) — primiti osobne podatke u lako upotrebljivom obliku\n"
"\n"
"Za ostvarivanje prava na uvid, brisanje, ispravak ili prenosivost pišite na **{{COMPANY_EMAIL}}**. Riječ je o provjerljivim zahtjevima potrošača pa ćemo prije postupanja provjeriti vaš identitet (CCPA § 1798.130(a)(2)) i odgovoriti u roku od **45 dana** (uz obavijest produživo na 90 dana, § 1798.130(a)(2)(B)).\n"
"\n"
"Za odbijanje prodaje ili dijeljenja vaših osobnih podataka upotrijebite poveznice „Do Not Sell or Share“ i „Upravljanje postavkama“ u podnožju web-stranice. Za ograničenje naše uporabe osjetljivih osobnih podataka pišite na **{{COMPANY_EMAIL}}**. Ni odbijanje ni zahtjev za ograničenje nisu provjerljiv zahtjev potrošača (CPPA Reg. § 7060(b)): postupit ćemo po oba bez traženja provjere identiteta ili otvaranja računa.\n"
"\n"
"Možete i ovlastiti zastupnika da podnese zahtjev u vaše ime (Cal. Civ. Code § 1798.135(c))."

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:219
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: ccpa-california / section-9"
msgid ""
"## Global Privacy Control (GPC)\n"
