#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:340
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: popia-southafrica / introduction"
msgid ""
"# Cookie Policy\n"
"\n"
"**Last updated:** {{LAST_UPDATED_DATE}}\n"
"\n"
"This Cookie Policy explains how **{{COMPANY_NAME}}** (\"we\", \"us\", \"our\") uses cookies and similar technologies on this website, in compliance with the Protection of Personal Information Act, 2013 (POPIA) of South Africa and the regulations issued by the Information Regulator."
msgstr ""
"# Pravila o kolačićima\n"
"\n"
"**Zadnje ažurirano:** {{LAST_UPDATED_DATE}}\n"
"\n"
"Ova Pravila o kolačićima objašnjavaju kako **{{COMPANY_NAME}}** („mi“, „nas“, „naš“) koristi kolačiće i slične tehnologije na ovoj internetskoj stranici, u skladu sa Zakonom o zaštiti osobnih podataka iz 2013. (POPIA) Južnoafričke Republike i propisima koje je izdao Information Regulator."

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:349
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: popia-southafrica / section-1"
msgid ""
"## Who we are\n"
"\n"
"The responsible party for the processing of your personal information through cookies is:\n"
"\n"
"- **Responsible party:** {{COMPANY_NAME}}\n"
"- **Address:** {{COMPANY_ADDRESS}}\n"
"- **Email:** {{COMPANY_EMAIL}}\n"
"- **Registry / registration number:** {{COMPANY_REGISTRY}}\n"
"- **Information Officer:** {{DPO_NAME}} — {{DPO_EMAIL}}"
msgstr ""
"## Tko smo mi\n"
"\n"
"Odgovorna strana (responsible party) za obradu vaših osobnih podataka putem kolačića je:\n"
"\n"
"- **Odgovorna strana:** {{COMPANY_NAME}}\n"
"- **Adresa:** {{COMPANY_ADDRESS}}\n"
"- **E-pošta:** {{COMPANY_EMAIL}}\n"
"- **Registar / matični broj:** {{COMPANY_REGISTRY}}\n"
"- **Information Officer:** {{DPO_NAME}} — {{DPO_EMAIL}}"

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:362
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: popia-southafrica / section-2"
msgid ""
"## What are cookies\n"
"\n"
"Cookies are small text files placed on your device when you visit our website. They allow us to recognize your device on subsequent visits, remember your preferences, measure how the site is used, and (with your consent) deliver personalized advertising.\n"
"\n"
"We also use similar technologies such as **localStorage**, **sessionStorage**, and **pixel tags**. Where this policy refers to \"cookies\", it covers these technologies as well."
msgstr ""
"## Što su kolačići\n"
"\n"
"Kolačići su male tekstualne datoteke koje se postavljaju na vaš uređaj kada posjetite našu internetsku stranicu. Omogućuju nam da prepoznamo vaš uređaj prilikom sljedećih posjeta, zapamtimo vaše postavke, izmjerimo način korištenja stranice te (uz vašu privolu) prikažemo personalizirano oglašavanje.\n"
"\n"
"Koristimo i slične tehnologije poput **localStorage**, **sessionStorage** i **piksel oznaka (pixel tags)**. Kada ova pravila spominju „kolačiće“, to obuhvaća i te tehnologije."

#: admin/modules/cookie-policy-generator/includes/cookie-policy-gettext-catalog.php:371
msgctxt "Cookie policy template: popia-southafrica / section-3"
msgid ""
"## Lawful basis for processing\n"
"\n"
"For **strictly necessary** cookies, processing is justified because it is necessary to pursue our legitimate interests in operating a secure, functional website (POPIA section 11(1)(f)) and does not override your interests or rights.\n"
"\n"
"For the **non-essential categories configured behind our cookie banner**, processing is based on your **consent** under POPIA section 11(1)(a) — a voluntary, specific and informed expression of will — collected before those cookies are set. POPIA section 11(1)(b)-(f) permits other lawful justifications; this policy uses consent for these configured categories and must be adapted if our actual processing relies on a different justification.\n"
"\n"
"Personal information collected through these technologies may include online identifiers, device and browser information, usage events, approximate location, and the preferences described in the cookie table and our separate Privacy Policy. Providing information through non-essential technologies is voluntary; if you refuse, the related analytics, personalization, or advertising functions will not operate. Processing needed to deliver and secure the website is necessary for those technical functions, and blocking it may prevent parts of the site from working.\n"
"\n"
"You can withdraw consent at any time using the \"Cookie settings\" link or by clearing your cookies (POPIA section 11(2)(b)). Withdrawal does not affect the lawfulness of processing carried out before withdrawal."
msgstr ""
"## Zakonita osnova za obradu\n"
"\n"
"Za **strogo nužne** kolačiće, obrada je opravdana jer je nužna za ostvarivanje naših legitimnih interesa u radu sigurne i funkcionalne internetske stranice (POPIA, section 11(1)(f)) i ne nadilazi vaše interese ili prava.\n"
"\n"
"Za **nenužne kategorije konfigurirane iza našeg bannera za kolačiće**, obrada se temelji na vašoj **privoli** prema POPIA, section 11(1)(a) — dobrovoljnom, specifičnom i informiranom izražavanju volje — prikupljenoj prije postavljanja tih kolačića. POPIA, section 11(1)(b)-(f) dopušta i druge zakonite osnove; ova pravila koriste privolu za ove konfigurirane kategorije i moraju se prilagoditi ako se naša stvarna obrada temelji na drugoj osnovi.\n"
"\n"
"Osobni podaci prikupljeni putem ovih tehnologija mogu uključivati mrežne identifikatore, podatke o uređaju i pregledniku, događaje korištenja, približnu lokaciju te preferencije opisane u tablici kolačića i našim zasebnim Pravilima o privatnosti. Pružanje podataka putem nenužnih tehnologija je dobrovoljno; ako to odbijete, povezane funkcije analitike, personalizacije ili oglašavanja neće raditi. Obrada potrebna za pružanje i sigurnost internetske stranice nužna je za te tehničke funkcije, a njezino blokiranje može onemogućiti rad pojedinih dijelova stranice.\n"
"\n"
"Privolu možete povući u bilo kojem trenutku putem poveznice „Postavke kolačića“ ili brisanjem kolačića (POPIA, section 11(2)(b)). Povlačenje ne utječe na zakonitost obrade izvršene prije povlačenja."

