#: admin/views/cookie-policy.php:210
msgid "Policy text"
msgstr "Tekst pravila"

#: admin/views/cookie-policy.php:218
msgid "<strong>You probably don't need this.</strong> The shipped sections are reviewed starting points. Fill a box only to replace that section with your own wording — placeholders such as <code>{{COMPANY_NAME}}</code> keep working inside it. Text you write here is <strong>your</strong> document, so review the disclaimer setting below accordingly. Leave a box empty to keep the shipped text."
msgstr "<strong>Ovo vam vjerojatno ne treba.</strong> Isporučeni odjeljci su provjerene početne točke. Ispunite polje samo kako biste zamijenili taj odjeljak vlastitim tekstom — zamjenski parametri poput <code>{{COMPANY_NAME}}</code> i dalje funkcioniraju unutar njega. Tekst koji ovdje napišete <strong>vaš</strong> je dokument, stoga sukladno tome pregledajte postavku odricanja od odgovornosti u nastavku. Ostavite polje praznim kako biste zadržali isporučeni tekst."

