msgstr "Redigiranje podataka o oglasima"

#: admin/views/gcm.php:107
msgid "Redact ad click identifiers when ad_storage is denied."
msgstr "Redigiraj identifikatore klikova na oglase kada je ad_storage odbijen."

#: admin/views/gcm.php:113
msgid "Serve non-personalized ads when consent is denied"
msgstr "Prikazuj nepersonalizirane oglase kada je privola odbijena"

#: admin/views/gcm.php:116
msgid "When a visitor rejects marketing cookies, ad_storage / ad_user_data / ad_personalization all stay denied (no ad cookies are written) and the plugin signals npa = 1. Under Consent Mode v2 this already serves non-personalized, cookieless ads — compliant in the EEA/UK/CH. The plugin no longer grants ad_storage after a reject."
msgstr "Kada posjetitelj odbije marketinške kolačiće, ad_storage / ad_user_data / ad_personalization ostaju svi odbijeni (ne zapisuju se reklamni kolačići) i dodatak šalje signal npa = 1. U Consent Mode v2 to već omogućuje prikazivanje nepersonaliziranih oglasa bez kolačića — sukladno propisima u EGP-u/UK-u/CH-u. Dodatak više ne odobrava ad_storage nakon odbijanja."

#: admin/views/gcm.php:123
msgid "Advanced Consent Mode (load Google tags before consent)"
msgstr "Napredni način privole (učitaj Google oznake prije privole)"

#: admin/views/gcm.php:126
msgid "This lets Google tags (gtag.js / GA4 / Google Ads) load BEFORE consent."
msgstr "Ovo omogućuje učitavanje Google oznaka (gtag.js / GA4 / Google Ads) PRIJE privole."

#: admin/views/gcm.php:127
msgid "They run with consent default → denied, so pre-consent hits are cookieless (Google's \"Advanced\"/modeled mode) and upgrade to full measurement once the visitor accepts. Non-Google trackers and the Google Tag Manager container (gtm.js) stay fully blocked."
msgstr "Pokreću se sa zadanom postavkom privole → odbijeno, pa su pozivi prije privole bez kolačića (Googleov „Napredni“/modelirani način) i nadograđuju se na potpuno mjerenje čim posjetitelj prihvati. Alati za praćenje koji nisu Google i kontejner Google Tag Managera (gtm.js) ostaju potpuno blokirani."

#: admin/views/gcm.php:128
msgid "Leave this OFF for the strictest, block-everything-before-consent behaviour. Loading Google before consent is a legal judgement call: some EU authorities still treat cookieless pings as a third-party transfer, so enabling it is your responsibility as the site operator. Default: off."
msgstr "Ostavite ovo ISKLJUČENO za najstrože ponašanje blokiranja svega prije privole. Učitavanje Googlea prije privole pravna je procjena: neka tijela u EU-u i dalje tretiraju pozive bez kolačića kao prijenos trećoj strani, pa je omogućavanje ovoga vaša odgovornost kao operatera stranice. Zadano: isključeno."

