#: admin/views/settings.php:14
msgid "Banner Control"
msgstr "Kontrola bannera"

#: admin/views/settings.php:23
msgid "When disabled, the cookie consent banner will not appear on your site and no scripts will be blocked."
msgstr "Kada je onemogućeno, banner za privolu kolačića neće se prikazivati na vašoj stranici i skripte se neće blokirati."

#: admin/views/settings.php:26
msgid "Excluded Pages"
msgstr "Izuzete stranice"

#: admin/views/settings.php:27
msgid "One per line: page ID or URL pattern like /privacy/*"
msgstr "Jedan unos po retku: ID stranice ili URL obrazac poput /privacy/*"

#: admin/views/settings.php:28
msgid "Enter page IDs or URL patterns, one per line."
msgstr "Unesite ID-jeve stranica ili URL obrasce, jedan po retku."

#: admin/views/settings.php:34
msgid "Hide banner from search engine bots"
msgstr "Sakrij banner od robota tražilica"

#: admin/views/settings.php:36
msgid "Automatically detects search engine crawlers (Googlebot, Bingbot, etc.) and skips the banner for them. Improves SEO by serving cleaner HTML to crawlers. Note: with Cache Compatibility Mode enabled the bot-skip is bypassed — cached pages must stay identical for every visitor, so bots receive the banner too."
msgstr "Automatski otkriva tražilične robote (Googlebot, Bingbot, itd.) i za njih preskače banner. Poboljšava SEO posluživanjem čišćeg HTML-a robotima. Napomena: kada je omogućen Način kompatibilnosti s predmemorijom, preskakanje robota se zaobilazi — predmemorirane stranice moraju ostati identične za svakog posjetitelja, pa i roboti primaju banner."

#: admin/views/settings.php:42
msgid "Push consent events to GTM Data Layer"
msgstr "Šalji događaje privole u GTM Data Layer"

#: admin/views/settings.php:44
msgid "Pushes a faz_consent_update event with per-category granted/denied values to window.dataLayer after each consent action. Enable if you use Google Tag Manager."
msgstr "Šalje događaj faz_consent_update s vrijednostima granted/denied po kategoriji u window.dataLayer nakon svake radnje privole. Omogućite ako koristite Google Tag Manager."

#: admin/views/settings.php:50
msgid "Ad-blocker compatibility mode"
msgstr "Način kompatibilnosti s blokatorima oglasa"

#: admin/views/settings.php:52
msgid "Serves every frontend bundle (banner, accessibility, GCM, TCF, WP Consent API and Microsoft consent) through generic inline handles so plugin-URL filter rules cannot block only part of the consent runtime."
msgstr "Poslužuje svaki frontend paket (banner, pristupačnost, GCM, TCF, WP Consent API i Microsoft privolu) putem generičkih ugrađenih (inline) identifikatora, tako da filtarska pravila po URL-u dodatka ne mogu blokirati samo dio sustava privole u stvarnom vremenu."

#: admin/views/settings.php:58
msgid "Keep banner visible against ad blockers"
msgstr "Zadrži banner vidljivim unatoč blokatorima oglasa"

#: admin/views/settings.php:60
msgid "If an ad blocker's cosmetic filter list hides the consent banner (some lists hide any element whose name contains \"cookie\" or \"consent\"), this re-asserts the banner's visibility a few times over the first seconds after it loads, so the legally required notice is not suppressed even when the filter list is applied late. It never forces interaction and respects a visitor who has already accepted, rejected or dismissed. This is different from Ad-blocker compatibility mode above, which stops the banner script itself from being blocked."
msgstr "Ako kozmetički popis filtara blokatora oglasa sakrije banner za privolu (neki popisi skrivaju svaki element čiji naziv sadrži „cookie“ ili „consent“), ova opcija ponovno potvrđuje vidljivost bannera nekoliko puta tijekom prvih sekundi nakon učitavanja, kako zakonski obavezna obavijest ne bi bila potisnuta čak i kada se popis filtara primijeni sa zakašnjenjem. Nikada ne prisiljava interakciju i poštuje posjetitelja koji je već prihvatio, odbio ili odbacio banner. Ovo se razlikuje od gornjeg Načina kompatibilnosti s blokatorima oglasa, koji sprječava blokiranje same skripte bannera."

#: admin/views/settings.php:66
msgid "Enable per-service consent"
msgstr "Omogući privolu po usluzi"

#: admin/views/settings.php:68
msgid "When enabled, visitors can accept or reject individual services (e.g., Google Analytics, YouTube) instead of entire categories. Services detected by the scanner are shown immediately, and embedded providers blocked at runtime are revealed when the browser sees them on the page. This keeps the preference center present-aware but makes it more complex."
msgstr "Kada je omogućeno, posjetitelji mogu prihvatiti ili odbiti pojedinačne usluge (npr. Google Analytics, YouTube) umjesto cijelih kategorija. Usluge koje otkrije skener prikazuju se odmah, a ugrađeni pružatelji blokirani u runtimeu otkrivaju se kada ih preglednik vidi na stranici. Time centar postavki ostaje svjestan stvarne prisutnosti usluga, ali postaje složeniji."

#: admin/views/settings.php:96
msgid "Enable per-cookie consent"
msgstr "Omogući privolu po kolačiću"

#: admin/views/settings.php:98
msgid "Requires per-service consent. Adds a nested row for each cookie a service declares. First-party cookies that the site can write are enforced by client cleanup and the server-side shredder. Cookies set by embedded third-party services on their own domains (for example YouTube, Vimeo, Maps, social embeds) cannot be deleted individually by this site; those rows are shown as disabled and are controlled by allowing or blocking the whole embed."
msgstr "Zahtijeva privolu po usluzi. Dodaje ugniježđeni redak za svaki kolačić koji usluga deklarira. First-party kolačići koje web-mjesto može zapisati provode se klijentskim čišćenjem i poslužiteljskim shredderom. Kolačiće koje ugrađene usluge trećih strana postavljaju na vlastitim domenama (na primjer YouTube, Vimeo, Maps, društveni embedovi) ovo web-mjesto ne može pojedinačno izbrisati; ti se redci prikazuju kao onemogućeni i kontroliraju se dopuštanjem ili blokiranjem cijelog embeda."

#: admin/views/settings.php:104
msgid "Share consent across subdomains"
msgstr "Dijeli privolu među poddomenama"

#: admin/views/settings.php:106
msgid "Scope the consent cookie to your registrable domain (e.g. .example.com) so it is shared across www, shop, app, etc. Recommended only when all subdomains belong to you and are covered by the same privacy policy. Public-suffix-aware for multi-level TLDs (.co.uk, .com.au)."
msgstr "Ogranite kolačić privole na svoju registrabilnu domenu (npr. .example.com) kako bi se dijelio na www, shop, app itd. Preporučuje se samo kada svi poddomeni pripadaju vama i pokriveni su istom politikom privatnosti. Podržava javne sufikse za višerazinske TLD-ove (.co.uk, .com.au)."

#: admin/views/settings.php:112
msgid "Cache compatibility mode"
msgstr "Način kompatibilnosti s predmemorijom"

#: admin/views/settings.php:114
msgid "Keep a visitor-invariant page fully cacheable when jurisdiction enforcement is off and one banner law applies to everyone. When per-country enforcement is on, use the Cache-safe jurisdiction bootstrap under Jurisdiction &amp; Geo-routing instead. Developers can override the runtime with the <code>faz_geo_ruleset_runtime</code> filter. When this compatibility mode is active, it also pauses server-side A/B splitting and bot-specific output."
msgstr "Održava stranicu jednaku za sve posjetitelje potpuno spremnom za predmemoriju kada je provedba nadležnosti isključena i jedan zakon bannera vrijedi za sve. Kada je provedba po zemlji uključena, umjesto toga upotrijebite bootstrap nadležnosti siguran za predmemoriju pod Nadležnost i geo-usmjeravanje. Programeri mogu nadjačati izvođenje filtrom <code>faz_geo_ruleset_runtime</code>. Kada je aktivan, ovaj način kompatibilnosti pauzira i A/B podjelu na poslužitelju te izlaz specifičan za robote."

#: admin/views/settings.php:120
msgid "A/B test banner variants"
msgstr "A/B testiraj varijante bannera"

#: admin/views/settings.php:122
msgid "Run two or more of your existing banners at the same time. A visitor is randomly shown one eligible variant without creating an experiment cookie before consent; after a choice, the banner slug in the consent record keeps the assignment stable. Acceptance rate per variant is reported on the Dashboard. Variants must use the same privacy-law and Do-Not-Sell model; country targeting is always respected, so the experiment can vary presentation but never a visitor's legal regime. <strong>Requires Cache Compatibility Mode above to be OFF</strong>, because a per-visitor split cannot run behind full-page caching."
msgstr "Pokrenite dva ili više svojih postojećih bannera istovremeno. Posjetitelju se nasumično prikazuje jedna prihvatljiva varijanta bez stvaranja kolačića eksperimenta prije privole; nakon izbora, slug bannera u zapisu privole održava dodjelu stabilnom. Stopa prihvaćanja po varijanti prikazuje se na Nadzornoj ploči. Varijante moraju koristiti isti zakon o privatnosti i model Ne prodaj; ciljanje prema državi uvijek se poštuje, tako da eksperiment može varirati prikaz, ali nikada pravni režim posjetitelja. <strong>Zahtijeva da gornji Način kompatibilnosti s predmemorijom bude ISKLJUČEN</strong>, jer podjela po posjetitelju ne može funkcionirati iza predmemoriranja cijele stranice."

#: admin/views/settings.php:125
msgid "Variants in the test group"
msgstr "Varijante u testnoj skupini"

#: admin/views/settings.php:126
msgid "Select two or more active banners with the same consent model. Incompatible or country-ineligible banners are ignored for that visitor."
msgstr "Odaberite dva ili više aktivnih bannera s istim modelom privole. Nekompatibilni banneri ili oni koji nisu prihvatljivi za državu posjetitelja se za tog posjetitelja zanemaruju."

#: admin/views/settings.php:128
msgid "Loading banners…"
msgstr "Učitavanje bannera…"

#. translators: %d: minimum age in years.
#: admin/views/settings.php:136 admin/views/system-status.php:101
msgid "Cross-Domain Consent"
msgstr "Privola između domena"

#: admin/views/settings.php:143
msgid "Enable cross-domain consent forwarding"
msgstr "Omogući prosljeđivanje privole između domena"

#: admin/views/settings.php:145
msgid "Share consent choices across multiple domains. When a visitor accepts or rejects cookies on one domain, the same choice is forwarded to all configured target domains via secure postMessage."
msgstr "Dijelite odabire privole između više domena. Kada posjetitelj prihvati ili odbije kolačiće na jednoj domeni, isti odabir prosljeđuje se svim konfiguriranim ciljnim domenama putem sigurnog postMessage mehanizma."

#: admin/views/settings.php:148
msgid "Target Domains"
msgstr "Ciljne domene"

#: admin/views/settings.php:149
msgid "One per line: https://shop.example.com"
msgstr "Jedna po retku: https://shop.example.com"

#: admin/views/settings.php:150
msgid "Full URLs of other sites that should receive consent state. Each site must also have FAZ Cookie Manager installed. One URL per line."
msgstr "Puni URL-ovi drugih stranica koje trebaju primiti stanje privole. Svaka stranica također mora imati instaliran FAZ Cookie Manager. Jedan URL po retku."

#: admin/views/settings.php:157 admin/views/system-status.php:82
msgid "Pageview Tracking"
msgstr "Praćenje pregleda stranica"

#: admin/views/settings.php:164
msgid "Enable pageview and banner interaction tracking"
msgstr "Omogući praćenje pregleda stranica i interakcija s bannerom"

#: admin/views/settings.php:166
msgid "Tracks pageviews and banner interactions (accept, reject, settings) for the dashboard analytics. Data is aggregate-only: it sends the page URL and title with no per-visitor identifier or cookie, so the events cannot be linked across pages or sessions. Counts are stored first-party in your own database. Disable for stricter compliance."
msgstr "Prati preglede stranica i interakcije s bannerom (prihvaćanje, odbijanje, postavke) za analitiku nadzorne ploče. Podaci su isključivo skupni: šalju se samo URL i naslov stranice, bez identifikatora pojedinog posjetitelja ili kolačića, pa se događaji ne mogu povezivati među stranicama ili sesijama. Brojevi se pohranjuju kao podaci prve strane u vašoj vlastitoj bazi podataka. Onemogućite za strožu usklađenost."

#: admin/views/settings.php:169
msgid "Pageview and interaction retention (months)"
msgstr "Čuvanje pregleda stranica i interakcija (mjeseci)"

#: admin/views/settings.php:171
msgid "How long aggregate pageview and banner-interaction records are kept before automatic deletion. Enter 0 to disable automatic deletion; choose and document a period appropriate to your analytics purpose. Default is 6 months."
msgstr "Koliko dugo se zbirni zapisi o pregledima stranica i interakcijama s bannerom čuvaju prije automatskog brisanja. Unesite 0 za onemogućavanje automatskog brisanja; odaberite i dokumentirajte razdoblje primjereno vašoj analitičkoj svrsi. Zadano je 6 mjeseci."

#: admin/views/settings.php:178
msgid "Script Blocking"
msgstr "Blokiranje skripti"

#: admin/views/settings.php:182
msgid "Pages Excluded from Script Blocking"
msgstr "Stranice izuzete iz blokiranja skripti"

#: admin/views/settings.php:183
msgid "One per line: /checkout/* or /cart/*"
msgstr "Jedan unos po retku: /checkout/* ili /cart/*"

#: admin/views/settings.php:184
msgid "URL patterns where script blocking is disabled (banner still shows). One per line, supports wildcards (e.g. <code>/checkout/*</code>)."
msgstr "URL obrasci na kojima je blokiranje skripti onemogućeno (banner se i dalje prikazuje). Jedan po retku, podržava zamjenske znakove (npr. <code>/checkout/*</code>)."

#: admin/views/settings.php:187
msgid "Script Blocking Exceptions"
msgstr "Iznimke blokiranja skripti"

#: admin/views/settings.php:188
msgid "One per line: googleapis.com/youtube/v3, recaptcha, my-inline-script-id"
msgstr "Jedan po retku: googleapis.com/youtube/v3, recaptcha, my-inline-script-id"

#: admin/views/settings.php:189
msgid "Scripts that should never be blocked, even before consent. One per line. Accepts three types of pattern:<br>- <strong>URL fragment</strong> (contains <code>.</code> or <code>/</code>): matched against the script's <code>src</code> or related URL attribute, e.g. <code>googleapis.com/youtube/v3</code>.<br>- <strong>Script ID</strong> (no dots/slashes): matched against the <code>id</code> attribute of the script tag, e.g. <code>my-product-form-data</code>.<br>- <strong>CSS class</strong> (no dots/slashes): matched against the script's <code>class</code> attribute, e.g. <code>recaptcha</code>.<br>- <strong>How IDs and classes match:</strong> whole words, plus their hyphen or underscore children. <code>recaptcha</code> matches <code>recaptcha</code>, <code>recaptcha-badge</code> and <code>recaptcha_frame</code>, but not <code>myrecaptcha</code>. Ending a pattern with <code>-</code> or <code>_</code> (e.g. <code>wp-</code>) matches <em>every</em> word starting with it, which is much broader — prefer the exact ID or class wherever you can.<br>These exceptions bypass blocking entirely. Use them only for scripts that genuinely do not set tracking cookies. <strong>Be specific</strong> to avoid accidentally unblocking trackers.<br><strong>Tip:</strong> You can also add <code>class=\"faz-skip\"</code> directly to any script tag to exclude it without adding anything here — no configuration needed."
msgstr "Skripte koje se nikada ne bi trebale blokirati, čak ni prije privole. Jedna po retku. Prihvaća tri vrste uzoraka:<br>- <strong>Dio URL-a</strong> (sadrži <code>.</code> ili <code>/</code>): uspoređuje se s atributom <code>src</code> skripte ili srodnim URL atributom, npr. <code>googleapis.com/youtube/v3</code>.<br>- <strong>ID skripte</strong> (bez točaka/kosih crta): uspoređuje se s atributom <code>id</code> oznake skripte, npr. <code>my-product-form-data</code>.<br>- <strong>CSS klasa</strong> (bez točaka/kosih crta): uspoređuje se s atributom <code>class</code> skripte, npr. <code>recaptcha</code>.<br>- <strong>Kako se ID-jevi i klase podudaraju:</strong> cijele riječi, uključujući njihove podređene oblike s crticom ili donjom crtom. <code>recaptcha</code> odgovara vrijednostima <code>recaptcha</code>, <code>recaptcha-badge</code> i <code>recaptcha_frame</code>, ali ne i <code>myrecaptcha</code>. Završavanje uzorka s <code>-</code> ili <code>_</code> (npr. <code>wp-</code>) odgovara <em>svakoj</em> riječi koja njime počinje, što je znatno šire — kad god možete, dajte prednost točnom ID-u ili klasi.<br>Ove iznimke u potpunosti zaobilaze blokiranje. Koristite ih samo za skripte koje doista ne postavljaju kolačiće za praćenje. <strong>Budite precizni</strong> kako biste izbjegli slučajno odblokiravanje alata za praćenje.<br><strong>Savjet:</strong> Također možete dodati <code>class=\"faz-skip\"</code> izravno u bilo koju oznaku skripte kako biste je isključili bez dodavanja ičega ovdje — nije potrebna nikakva konfiguracija."

#: admin/views/settings.php:195
msgid "Advanced inline CSS URL blocking"
msgstr "Napredno blokiranje URL-ova unutar ugrađenog (inline) CSS-a"

#: admin/views/settings.php:197
msgid "Optional high-coverage mode for CSS-based third-party loads. The default blocker already handles server-rendered <code>&lt;style&gt;</code> tags and direct <code>HTMLStyleElement</code> updates. Enable this only if you have confirmed that a theme, page builder, or CSS-in-JS library injects blocked <code>url()</code> or <code>@import</code> rules through broader runtime channels such as <code>Element.innerHTML</code>, <code>insertAdjacentHTML</code>, <code>CharacterData</code> edits inside a style tag, or Constructable Stylesheets. This strengthens pre-consent blocking but hooks global browser APIs and may affect builders, editors, icon fonts, or CSS-in-JS libraries. Test the site before enabling in production."
msgstr "Neobavezan način visoke pokrivenosti za učitavanja trećih strana temeljena na CSS-u. Zadani blokator već obrađuje oznake <code>&lt;style&gt;</code> generirane na poslužitelju i izravna ažuriranja <code>HTMLStyleElement</code>-a. Omogućite ovo samo ako ste potvrdili da tema, alat za izradu stranica ili CSS-in-JS biblioteka ubacuje blokirana <code>url()</code> ili <code>@import</code> pravila putem širih kanala u stvarnom vremenu poput <code>Element.innerHTML</code>, <code>insertAdjacentHTML</code>, izmjena <code>CharacterData</code> unutar style oznake, ili Constructable Stylesheets. Ovo pojačava blokiranje prije privole, ali kači se na globalne API-je preglednika i može utjecati na alate za izradu, uređivače, ikonografske fontove ili CSS-in-JS biblioteke. Testirajte stranicu prije omogućavanja u produkciji."

#: admin/views/settings.php:203
msgid "Block non-consented cookies emitted by PHP"
msgstr "Blokiraj kolačiće bez privole koje emitira PHP"

#: admin/views/settings.php:205
msgid "<strong>Advanced, off by default.</strong> Filters outgoing <code>Set-Cookie</code> headers from pages, AJAX, REST and redirects, including HttpOnly cookies that JavaScript cannot remove. Necessary, WordPress-internal, security and checkout cookies are preserved, and deletion headers always pass. Enable only after testing login, forms, cart and checkout; unknown cookies fail permissive until the scanner classifies them."
msgstr "<strong>Napredno, zadano isključeno.</strong> Filtrira odlazna <code>Set-Cookie</code> zaglavlja sa stranica, AJAX-a, REST-a i preusmjeravanja, uključujući HttpOnly kolačiće koje JavaScript ne može ukloniti. Nužni, WordPress-interni, sigurnosni kolačići i kolačići plaćanja se čuvaju, a zaglavlja za brisanje uvijek prolaze. Omogućite tek nakon testiranja prijave, obrazaca, košarice i naplate; nepoznati kolačići se dopuštaju (fail-open) dok ih skener ne klasificira."

#: admin/views/settings.php:209
msgid "Payment gateway scripts (e-commerce)"
msgstr "Skripte pružatelja usluga plaćanja (e-trgovina)"

#: admin/views/settings.php:210
msgid "<strong>Only enable a gateway if your site takes payments.</strong> A payment provider's SDK (PayPal, Stripe, …) can set cookies and fingerprint the visitor, so it is blocked until consent by default. Enabling a gateway here loads its <em>payment</em> scripts before consent across your site — needed for payment forms that live outside a WooCommerce checkout (Forminator, Paid Memberships Pro, Easy Digital Downloads, Give, …). This is a compliance decision and <strong>your responsibility</strong> for your jurisdiction. A real WooCommerce checkout/cart page already loads these automatically as strictly necessary; a gateway's marketing pixel (e.g. PayPal's <code>pptm.js</code>) stays blocked regardless."
msgstr "<strong>Omogućite pružatelja usluge plaćanja samo ako vaša stranica prima plaćanja.</strong> SDK pružatelja usluge plaćanja (PayPal, Stripe, …) može postavljati kolačiće i uzimati digitalni otisak posjetitelja, pa je zadano blokiran do privole. Omogućavanjem pružatelja ovdje učitavaju se njegove skripte za <em>plaćanje</em> prije privole na cijeloj vašoj stranici — potrebno za obrasce za plaćanje koji postoje izvan WooCommerce naplate (Forminator, Paid Memberships Pro, Easy Digital Downloads, Give, …). Ovo je odluka o usklađenosti i <strong>vaša odgovornost</strong> za vašu jurisdikciju. Prava WooCommerce stranica naplate/košarice već automatski učitava ove skripte kao strogo nužne; marketinški piksel pružatelja (npr. PayPal-ov <code>pptm.js</code>) ostaje blokiran bez obzira na to."

#. translators: %s: payment gateway name, e.g. PayPal.
#: admin/views/settings.php:217
#, php-format
msgid "Allow %s payment scripts before consent"
msgstr "Dopusti skripte za plaćanje %s prije privole"

#: admin/views/settings.php:235
msgid "Enable consent logging"
msgstr "Omogući bilježenje privole"

#: admin/views/settings.php:237
msgid "Records each visitor's consent choice (accepted, rejected, or partial) for GDPR accountability. Required by Art. 7(1) GDPR to demonstrate that consent was given."
msgstr "Bilježi svaki odabir privole posjetitelja (prihvaćeno, odbijeno ili djelomično) za GDPR odgovornost. Potrebno prema čl. 7. st. 1. GDPR-a za dokazivanje da je privola dana."

#: admin/views/settings.php:240
msgid "Consent log retention (months)"
msgstr "Čuvanje zapisnika privola (mjeseci)"

#: admin/views/settings.php:242
msgid "How long consent records are kept before automatic deletion. Choose a documented period appropriate to your accountability obligations. Logs older than this period are purged daily."
msgstr "Koliko dugo se zapisi privola čuvaju prije automatskog brisanja. Odaberite dokumentirano razdoblje primjereno vašim obvezama odgovornosti. Zapisi stariji od ovog razdoblja brišu se svakodnevno."

#: admin/views/settings.php:249
msgid "Data Subject Requests"
msgstr "Zahtjevi ispitanika"

#: admin/views/settings.php:253
msgid "Data subject request retention (months)"
msgstr "Čuvanje zahtjeva ispitanika (mjeseci)"

#: admin/views/settings.php:255
msgid "How long completed data-subject request records are kept before automatic deletion. Keep a period that supports your ability to demonstrate and manage requests."
msgstr "Koliko dugo se zapisi dovršenih zahtjeva ispitanika čuvaju prije automatskog brisanja. Zadržite razdoblje koje podržava vašu sposobnost dokazivanja i upravljanja zahtjevima."

#: admin/views/settings.php:262
msgid "Scanner"
msgstr "Skener"

#: admin/views/settings.php:266
msgid "Max Pages to Scan"
msgstr "Maks. broj stranica za skeniranje"

#: admin/views/settings.php:268
msgid "Maximum number of pages the cookie scanner will crawl. Higher values find more cookies but take longer. 100 pages is sufficient for most sites."
msgstr "Maksimalan broj stranica koje će skener kolačića obići. Veće vrijednosti pronalaze više kolačića, ali traju dulje. 100 stranica dovoljno je za većinu web-stranica."

#: admin/views/settings.php:271
msgid "Static public IP (optional)"
msgstr "Statička javna IP adresa (neobavezno)"

#: admin/views/settings.php:273
msgid "Pin every server-side scanner request — sitemap discovery and page fetches — to this site IP while preserving the hostname, HTTPS certificate validation and SNI. Only public IPv4/IPv6 addresses are accepted; requires the WordPress cURL transport. Leave blank to use DNS."
msgstr "Fiksirajte svaki zahtjev skenera na strani poslužitelja — otkrivanje mape stranice i dohvaćanje stranica — na IP adresu ove stranice, uz zadržavanje naziva hosta, provjere HTTPS certifikata i SNI-ja. Prihvaćaju se samo javne IPv4/IPv6 adrese; zahtijeva WordPress cURL transport. Ostavite prazno za korištenje DNS-a."

#: admin/views/settings.php:279
msgid "Scanner Debug Mode"
msgstr "Način otklanjanja pogrešaka skenera"

#: admin/views/settings.php:281
msgid "When enabled, the scanner logs every categorization decision. Download logs from the Cookies page."
msgstr "Kada je omogućeno, skener bilježi svaku odluku o kategorizaciji. Preuzmite zapisnike sa stranice Kolačići."

#: admin/views/settings.php:288
msgid "Automatic Scanning"
msgstr "Automatsko skeniranje"

#: admin/views/settings.php:295
msgid "Enable automatic cookie scanning"
msgstr "Omogući automatsko skeniranje kolačića"

#: admin/views/settings.php:297
msgid "Automatically scan your site for new cookies on a schedule. You will receive an email notification if new uncategorized cookies are found."
msgstr "Automatski skenirajte svoju stranicu za nove kolačiće prema rasporedu. Primit ćete e-mail obavijest ako se pronađu novi nekategorizirani kolačići."

#: admin/views/settings.php:300
msgid "Scan Frequency"
msgstr "Učestalost skeniranja"

#: admin/views/settings.php:302
msgid "Daily"
msgstr "Dnevno"

#: admin/views/settings.php:303 includes/class-activator.php:704
msgid "Weekly"
msgstr "Tjedno"

#: admin/views/settings.php:304
msgid "Monthly"
msgstr "Mjesečno"

#: admin/views/settings.php:306
msgid "How often the scanner runs automatically. Weekly is recommended for most sites."
msgstr "Koliko često se skener automatski pokreće. Tjedno je preporučeno za većinu stranica."

#: admin/views/settings.php:313
msgid "Microsoft Consent APIs"
msgstr "Microsoft Consent API-ji"

#: admin/views/settings.php:320
msgid "Microsoft UET Consent Mode"
msgstr "Microsoft UET Consent Mode"

#: admin/views/settings.php:322
msgid "Signals consent status to Microsoft Advertising (Bing Ads) via the UET tag. Enable if you use Microsoft Advertising and need to respect consent for ad tracking."
msgstr "Signalizira status privole Microsoft Advertisingu (Bing Ads) putem UET taga. Omogućite ako koristite Microsoft Advertising i trebate poštovati privolu za praćenje oglasa."

#: admin/views/settings.php:328
msgid "Microsoft Clarity Consent API"
msgstr "Microsoft Clarity Consent API"

#: admin/views/settings.php:330
msgid "Signals consent status to Microsoft Clarity (heatmaps and session recordings). Enable if you use Clarity and want it to pause tracking until consent is given."
msgstr "Signalizira status privole Microsoft Clarityju (heatmapovi i snimke sesija). Omogućite ako koristite Clarity i želite pauzirati praćenje dok privola nije dana."

#: admin/views/settings.php:337
msgid "Age Verification"
msgstr "Provjera dobi"

#: admin/views/settings.php:344
msgid "Require age verification for consent"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj provjeru dobi za privolu"

#: admin/views/settings.php:346
msgid "Under GDPR Art. 8, children below the minimum age cannot give valid consent for data processing. When enabled, the visitor sees an age-confirmation checkbox directly above the Accept/Reject buttons; it gates only the Accept path — Reject stays available and is never blocked, and the checkbox is never pre-ticked."
msgstr "Prema čl. 8. GDPR-a, djeca ispod minimalne dobi ne mogu dati valjanu privolu za obradu podataka. Kada je omogućeno, posjetitelj vidi potvrdni okvir za potvrdu dobi izravno iznad gumba Prihvati/Odbij; on uvjetuje samo put Prihvati — Odbij ostaje dostupan i nikada nije blokiran, a potvrdni okvir nikada nije unaprijed označen."

#: admin/views/settings.php:347
msgid "This is a self-declared age affirmation only. It is NOT a substitute for verifying parental consent for under-age children under GDPR Art. 8(2), which requires separate reasonable-efforts verification this feature does not provide."
msgstr "Ovo je samo samodeklarirana potvrda dobi. NIJE zamjena za provjeru roditeljske privole za maloljetnu djecu prema čl. 8. st. 2. GDPR-a, koji zahtijeva zasebnu provjeru razumnim naporima koju ova značajka ne pruža."

#: admin/views/settings.php:350
msgid "Minimum Age"
msgstr "Minimalna dob"

#: admin/views/settings.php:352
msgid "GDPR default is 16. Some EU member states allow 13-15 (e.g. Italy 14, Spain 14, France 15, Germany 16). Check your local law."
msgstr "Zadana vrijednost GDPR-a je 16. Neke države članice EU-a dopuštaju 13-15 (npr. Italija 14, Španjolska 14, Francuska 15, Njemačka 16). Provjerite svoj lokalni zakon."

#: admin/views/settings.php:359 admin/views/setup.php:185
msgid "IAB TCF"
msgstr "IAB TCF"

#: admin/views/settings.php:366
msgid "Enable IAB TCF v2.3"
msgstr "Omogući IAB TCF v2.3"

#: admin/views/settings.php:368
msgid "Enables the IAB Transparency & Consent Framework. Required if you work with ad-tech vendors that need a standardised TC String for programmatic advertising in the EU."
msgstr "Omogućuje IAB Transparency & Consent Framework. Potrebno ako radite s ad-tech dobavljačima kojima je potreban standardizirani TC String za programatsko oglašavanje u EU-u."

#: admin/views/settings.php:371
msgid "Publisher Country Code"
msgstr "Kod države izdavača"

#: admin/views/settings.php:373
msgid "ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 code of the publisher's country (e.g. IT, DE, FR). Used in the TCF consent string."
msgstr "ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 kod države izdavača (npr. IT, DE, FR). Koristi se u TCF stringu privole."

#: admin/views/settings.php:376 admin/views/setup.php:332
msgid "CMP ID"
msgstr "CMP ID"

#: admin/views/settings.php:378
msgid "Your registered IAB CMP ID (<a href=\"https://iabeurope.eu/cmp-list/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">IAB CMP List</a>). With ID&nbsp;0 the banner and cookie blocking work normally, but ad-tech vendors will ignore the TC String. Google Consent Mode v2 works regardless of CMP registration."
msgstr "Vaš registrirani IAB CMP ID (<a href=\"https://iabeurope.eu/cmp-list/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">IAB CMP popis</a>). S ID-jem&nbsp;0 banner i blokiranje kolačića rade normalno, ali ad-tech dobavljači ignorirat će TC String. Google Consent Mode v2 radi neovisno o CMP registraciji."

#: admin/views/settings.php:384
msgid "Purpose One Treatment"
msgstr "Purpose One Treatment"

#: admin/views/settings.php:386
msgid "Set to true if Purpose 1 consent was NOT disclosed (e.g. publisher in a country where Purpose 1 is not required)."
msgstr "Postavite na true ako privola za Purpose 1 NIJE objavljena (npr. izdavač u zemlji u kojoj Purpose 1 nije potreban)."

#: admin/views/settings.php:390
msgid "Loading GVL status..."
msgstr "Učitavanje GVL statusa..."

#: admin/views/settings.php:399
msgid "Jurisdiction & Geo-routing"
msgstr "Nadležnost i geo-usmjeravanje"

#: admin/views/settings.php:406
msgid "Apply jurisdiction rules by visitor location"
msgstr "Primijeni pravila nadležnosti prema lokaciji posjetitelja"

#: admin/views/settings.php:408
msgid "Recommended and enabled by default. Detect each visitor's location to enforce the matching jurisdiction rules and mandatory controls, and optionally limit banner display to selected regions. Turning this off means the law saved on the active banner applies to every visitor; for example, a CCPA banner will no longer gain GDPR blocking for an EEA visitor. Location requires a MaxMind GeoLite2 database (configured below), or a trusted country signal such as Cloudflare CF-IPCountry."
msgstr "Preporučeno i uključeno prema zadanim postavkama. Otkriva lokaciju svakog posjetitelja radi provedbe odgovarajućih pravila nadležnosti i obveznih kontrola te, po želji, ograničava prikaz bannera na odabrane regije. Isključivanje znači da se zakon spremljen u aktivnom banneru primjenjuje na svakog posjetitelja; primjerice, CCPA banner više neće dobiti GDPR blokiranje za posjetitelja iz EGP-a. Za lokaciju je potrebna MaxMind GeoLite2 baza konfigurirana u nastavku ili pouzdan signal zemlje poput Cloudflare CF-IPCountry."

#: admin/views/settings.php:414 admin/views/setup.php:360
msgid "Cache-safe jurisdiction bootstrap"
msgstr "Bootstrap nadležnosti siguran za predmemoriju"

#: admin/views/settings.php:416
msgid "Allows compatible full-page caches and CDNs to share one strict GDPR shell. The browser resolves the live jurisdiction through a no-store endpoint before mounting the banner or releasing optional scripts. If the configuration is unsupported or the endpoint fails, FAZ keeps the stricter shell and preserves the normal page-cache bypass."
msgstr "Omogućuje kompatibilnim predmemorijama cijele stranice i CDN-ovima dijeljenje jedne stroge GDPR ljuske. Preglednik određuje stvarnu nadležnost putem no-store krajnje točke prije postavljanja bannera ili oslobađanja neobaveznih skripti. Ako konfiguracija nije podržana ili krajnja točka ne uspije, FAZ zadržava strožu ljusku i uobičajeno zaobilaženje predmemorije stranice."

#: admin/views/settings.php:418
msgid "Checking cache-safe bootstrap readiness..."
msgstr "Provjera spremnosti bootstrapa sigurnog za predmemoriju..."

#: admin/views/settings.php:420
msgid "Currently excluded: AMP, IAB TCF, country-based language fallback, country-targeted banner rows, hiding the banner outside selected regions, and custom country-dependent output. Excluded configurations remain protected but bypass full-page caching."
msgstr "Trenutačno isključeno: AMP, IAB TCF, pričuvni jezik prema zemlji, banneri ciljani na zemlje, skrivanje bannera izvan odabranih regija i prilagođeni izlaz ovisan o zemlji. Isključene konfiguracije ostaju zaštićene, ali zaobilaze predmemoriju cijele stranice."

#: admin/views/settings.php:423
msgid "Target Regions"
msgstr "Ciljne regije"

#: admin/views/settings.php:427 admin/views/setup.php:168
msgid "EU / EEA"
msgstr "EU / EGP"

#: admin/views/settings.php:428 admin/views/setup.php:169
msgid "United Kingdom"
msgstr "Ujedinjeno Kraljevstvo"

#: admin/views/settings.php:429 admin/views/setup.php:170
msgid "United States"
msgstr "Sjedinjene Američke Države"

#: admin/views/settings.php:430 admin/views/setup.php:171
msgid "Canada"
msgstr "Kanada"

#: admin/views/settings.php:431 admin/views/setup.php:172
msgid "Brazil"
msgstr "Brazil"

#: admin/views/settings.php:433 admin/views/setup.php:174
msgid "Japan"
msgstr "Japan"

#: admin/views/settings.php:434 admin/views/setup.php:175
msgid "Switzerland"
msgstr "Švicarska"

#: admin/views/settings.php:435 admin/views/setup.php:176
msgid "South Africa"
msgstr "Južnoafrička Republika"

#: admin/views/settings.php:445
msgid "Select which regions should see the cookie banner. Visitors from other regions will not see it (if \"Hide banner\" is selected below)."
msgstr "Odaberite koje regije trebaju vidjeti banner za kolačiće. Posjetitelji iz drugih regija neće ga vidjeti (ako je dolje odabrano „Sakrij banner”)."

#: admin/views/settings.php:448
msgid "Non-target visitors"
msgstr "Posjetitelji izvan ciljanih regija"

#: admin/views/settings.php:450
msgid "Show banner anyway (safest)"
msgstr "Svejedno prikaži banner (najsigurnije)"

#: admin/views/settings.php:451
msgid "Hide banner (scripts load normally)"
msgstr "Sakrij banner (skripte se učitavaju normalno)"

#: admin/views/settings.php:453
msgid "What happens when a visitor is from outside the target regions. \"Show banner anyway\" is the safest option and recommended for sites with global audiences."
msgstr "Što se događa kada je posjetitelj izvan ciljanih regija. „Svejedno prikaži banner” najsigurnija je opcija i preporučuje se za stranice s globalnom publikom."

#: admin/views/settings.php:460
msgid "GeoIP Database (MaxMind GeoLite2)"
msgstr "GeoIP baza podataka (MaxMind GeoLite2)"

#: admin/views/settings.php:464
msgid "Geo-targeting requires a MaxMind GeoLite2 database. <a href=\"https://www.maxmind.com/en/geolite2/signup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get a free license key</a>."
msgstr "Geociljanje zahtijeva MaxMind GeoLite2 bazu podataka. <a href=\"https://www.maxmind.com/en/geolite2/signup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Nabavite besplatni licencni ključ</a>."

#: admin/views/settings.php:467
msgid "Database edition"
msgstr "Izdanje baze podataka"

#: admin/views/settings.php:469
msgid "Country &#8212; country-level only (recommended)"
msgstr "Country &#8212; samo na razini države (preporučeno)"

#: admin/views/settings.php:470
msgid "City &#8212; adds region / state detection"
msgstr "City &#8212; dodaje otkrivanje regije/savezne države"

#: admin/views/settings.php:473
msgid "<strong>Country</strong> (~10 MB) resolves the visitor&#8217;s country only &#8212; enough for country-based banner targeting and most per-jurisdiction rules. <strong>City</strong> (~60&#8211;110 MB) additionally resolves the region / province / state, which a few rules need: sub-national regimes such as <em>Quebec Law 25</em> apply only inside one region of a country, so without City (or a Cloudflare <code>CF-Region-Code</code> header) the plugin can only see &#8220;Canada&#8221; and cannot route that visitor to the Quebec ruleset. Choose City only if you rely on region-level routing &#8212; it is a much larger download. Changing this and clicking &#8220;Update Database&#8221; replaces the installed database."
msgstr "<strong>Country</strong> (~10 MB) razlučuje samo državu posjetitelja &#8212; dovoljno za ciljanje banera po državi i većinu pravila po jurisdikciji. <strong>City</strong> (~60&#8211;110 MB) dodatno razlučuje regiju / pokrajinu / saveznu državu, što je potrebno za nekoliko pravila: subnacionalni režimi poput <em>Zakona 25 iz Quebeca</em> primjenjuju se samo unutar jedne regije države, pa bez Cityja (ili Cloudflareova zaglavlja <code>CF-Region-Code</code>) dodatak vidi samo &#8220;Kanadu&#8221; i ne može usmjeriti tog posjetitelja na ruleset Quebeca. Odaberite City samo ako se oslanjate na usmjeravanje na razini regije &#8212; riječ je o znatno većem preuzimanju. Promjena ove postavke i klik na &#8220;Ažuriraj bazu podataka&#8221; zamjenjuje instaliranu bazu."

#: admin/views/settings.php:477
msgid "MaxMind License Key"
msgstr "MaxMind licencni ključ"

#: admin/views/settings.php:478
msgid "Enter your MaxMind license key"
msgstr "Unesite svoj MaxMind licencni ključ"

#: admin/views/settings.php:482
msgid "Update Database"
msgstr "Ažuriraj bazu podataka"

#: admin/views/settings.php:488
msgid "Data Management"
msgstr "Upravljanje podacima"

#: admin/views/settings.php:495
msgid "Remove all data on uninstall"
msgstr "Ukloni sve podatke pri deinstalaciji"

#: admin/views/settings.php:497
msgid "When enabled, deleting the plugin will permanently remove ALL data: cookies, categories, consent logs, pageviews, banner settings, and scan history. Keep this OFF if you plan to reinstall or update the plugin."
msgstr "Kada je omogućeno, brisanje dodatka trajno će ukloniti SVE podatke: kolačiće, kategorije, zapisnike pristanka, preglede stranica, postavke bannera i povijest skeniranja. Ostavite ovo ISKLJUČENO ako planirate reinstalirati ili ažurirati dodatak."

#: admin/views/settings.php:500
msgid "Privacy Request Retention Period (months)"
msgstr "Razdoblje čuvanja zahtjeva za privatnost (mjeseci)"

#: admin/views/settings.php:502
msgid "How long completed privacy (DSAR) request records are kept before automatic deletion. They are the evidence that a data-subject request was answered, so a minimum of 12–24 months is recommended. Default is 24 months."
msgstr "Koliko dugo se zapisi dovršenih zahtjeva za privatnost (DSAR) čuvaju prije automatskog brisanja. Oni su dokaz da je odgovoreno na zahtjev ispitanika, pa se preporučuje najmanje 12–24 mjeseca. Zadano je 24 mjeseca."

#: admin/views/settings.php:510
msgid "Paid Memberships Pro integration"
msgstr "Integracija Paid Memberships Pro"

#: admin/views/settings.php:514
msgid "Offer selected Paid Memberships Pro levels a privacy-preserving membership alternative: logged-in members skip the cookie banner, necessary storage remains available, and <strong>all optional purposes stay denied</strong> until the member explicitly changes them in the preference center. Other visitors continue to use the standard consent flow."
msgstr "Ponudite odabranim razinama Paid Memberships Pro alternativu članstva koja čuva privatnost: prijavljeni članovi preskaču banner za kolačiće, nužna pohrana ostaje dostupna, a <strong>sve neobavezne svrhe ostaju odbijene</strong> dok ih član izričito ne promijeni u centru postavki. Ostali posjetitelji nastavljaju koristiti standardni tijek privole."

#: admin/views/settings.php:517
msgid "Legal note:"
msgstr "Pravna napomena:"

#: admin/views/settings.php:518
msgid "This option does not grant consent on the member's behalf. Disclose the privacy-preserving membership alternative in your Terms and Privacy Policy, keep the paid service genuinely equivalent, and leave the standard preference control available so members can change any optional purpose at any time. Assess your specific model with qualified counsel; EDPB Opinion 08/2024 does not make every consent-or-pay implementation lawful."
msgstr "Ova opcija ne daje privolu u ime člana. Objavite alternativu članstva koja čuva privatnost u svojim Uvjetima korištenja i Pravilima o privatnosti, održavajte plaćenu uslugu istinski jednakovrijednom te ostavite dostupnom standardnu kontrolu postavki kako bi članovi mogli promijeniti bilo koju neobaveznu svrhu u bilo kojem trenutku. Procijenite svoj specifični model uz kvalificirano pravno savjetovanje; Mišljenje EDPB-a 08/2024 ne čini svaku implementaciju consent-or-pay zakonitom."

#: admin/views/settings.php:524
msgid "Enable PMP integration"
msgstr "Omogući PMP integraciju"

#: admin/views/settings.php:528
msgid "Exempt membership level IDs"
msgstr "ID-ovi razina članstva koji su izuzeti"

#: admin/views/settings.php:529
msgid "e.g. 2, 3, 5"
msgstr "npr. 2, 3, 5"

#: admin/views/settings.php:531
msgid "Comma-separated PMP level IDs whose members should be exempted. Find level IDs in <strong>Memberships → Settings → Levels</strong>. Leave empty to disable exemption."
msgstr "ID-ovi PMP razina odvojeni zarezima čiji bi članovi trebali biti izuzeti. ID-ove razina pronađite u <strong>Memberships → Settings → Levels</strong>. Ostavite prazno za onemogućavanje izuzeća."

#: admin/views/settings.php:540
msgid "Footer legal links"
msgstr "Pravne poveznice u podnožju"

#: admin/views/settings.php:547
msgid "Show legal links in the footer"
msgstr "Prikaži pravne poveznice u podnožju"

#: admin/views/settings.php:549
msgid "Off by default. When enabled, the pages you select below are printed as a small navigation block in your theme footer (via wp_footer). The markup is identical for every visitor — it does not depend on consent, login state or country — so it stays safe to serve from a page cache."
msgstr "Zadano isključeno. Kada je omogućeno, stranice koje odaberete u nastavku ispisuju se kao mali navigacijski blok u podnožju vaše teme (putem wp_footer). Oznake su identične za svakog posjetitelja — ne ovise o privoli, statusu prijave ili državi — pa je sigurno poslužiti ih iz predmemorije stranice."

#: admin/views/settings.php:552
msgid "Pages to link"
msgstr "Stranice za povezivanje"

#. translators: %d: WordPress page ID.
#: admin/views/settings.php:590
#, php-format
msgid "Page #%d (unavailable)"
msgstr "Stranica #%d (nedostupno)"

#. translators: %d: WordPress page ID.
#: admin/views/settings.php:596
#, php-format
msgid "Page #%d (untitled)"
msgstr "Stranica #%d (bez naslova)"

#: admin/views/settings.php:626
msgid "No published pages yet. Publish your Cookie Policy or Privacy Policy page first."
msgstr "Još nema objavljenih stranica. Najprije objavite svoju stranicu Pravila o kolačićima ili Pravila o privatnosti."

#: admin/views/settings.php:635
msgid "Custom label (optional)"
msgstr "Prilagođena oznaka (neobavezno)"

#: admin/views/settings.php:639
msgid "Selected links appear first in their saved order. Leave the label empty to use the page title. Unpublished or unavailable selections stay visible here so you can remove them; they are never printed in the footer."
msgstr "Odabrane poveznice prikazuju se prvo, prema spremljenom redoslijedu. Ostavite oznaku praznom kako biste koristili naslov stranice. Neobjavljeni ili nedostupni odabiri ostaju vidljivi ovdje kako biste ih mogli ukloniti; nikada se ne ispisuju u podnožju."

#: admin/views/settings.php:647
msgid "Force re-consent"
msgstr "Prisilno zatražiti novi pristanak"

#: admin/views/settings.php:651
msgid "Show the cookie banner again to all returning visitors. Useful when you change which cookies or services are used on your site (e.g. new AdSense tags, added analytics) and want prior visitors to renew their consent before those services run."
msgstr "Prikaži banner s kolačićima ponovo svim povratnim posjetiteljima. Korisno kada promijenite koji se kolačići ili usluge koriste na vašoj web-stranici (npr. novi AdSense oznake, dodana analitika) i želite da prethodni posjetitelji obnove svoju privolu prije nego što te usluge budu pokrenute."

#: admin/views/settings.php:654
msgid "Current consent revision"
msgstr "Trenutna revizija pristanka"

#: admin/views/settings.php:658
msgid "Invalidate all consents"
msgstr "Poništi sve pristanke"

#: admin/views/settings.php:661
msgid "Visitors whose stored consent has a lower revision will see the banner again on their next visit. This does not affect the current page load."
msgstr "Posjetitelji čija pohranjena suglasnost ima nižu reviziju vidjet æe banner ponovo pri sljedećem posjetu. Ovo ne utječe na trenutno učitavanje stranice."

#: admin/views/settings.php:669
msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "Spremi postavke"

#: admin/views/setup.php:100
msgid "GDPR / ePrivacy (EU, EEA, UK)"
msgstr "GDPR / e-privatnost (EU, EGP, UK)"

#: admin/views/setup.php:101
msgid "For visitors in the European Union, EEA, or United Kingdom. Non-essential cookies stay blocked until the visitor actively opts in — nothing is pre-ticked, and Accept and Reject carry equal weight."
msgstr "Za posjetitelje iz Europske unije, EGP-a ili Ujedinjenog Kraljevstva. Nenužni kolačići ostaju blokirani dok posjetitelj aktivno ne pristane — ništa nije unaprijed označeno, a gumbi Prihvati i Odbij imaju jednaku težinu."

#: admin/views/setup.php:102
msgid "Opt-in model: no cookie is set before consent."
msgstr "Opt-in model: nijedan kolačić se ne postavlja prije privole."

#: admin/views/setup.php:103 admin/views/setup.php:117
#: admin/views/setup.php:124
msgid "Consent is remembered for up to 180 days."
msgstr "Privola se pamti do 180 dana."

#: admin/views/setup.php:104 admin/views/setup.php:125
msgid "Equal-weight Accept and Reject buttons are shown, with no pre-ticked categories."
msgstr "Prikazuju se gumbi Prihvati i Odbij jednake težine, bez unaprijed označenih kategorija."

#: admin/views/setup.php:107
msgid "CCPA / US State laws"
msgstr "CCPA / zakoni saveznih država SAD-a"

#: admin/views/setup.php:108
msgid "For visitors covered by California (CCPA/CPRA) and similar US state privacy laws. These follow an opt-out model: a first-party \"Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\" link lets visitors withdraw at any time."
msgstr "Za posjetitelje obuhvaćene kalifornijskim (CCPA/CPRA) i sličnim zakonima o privatnosti saveznih država SAD-a. Oni slijede opt-out model: poveznica prve strane „Ne prodaj niti dijeli moje osobne podatke“ omogućuje posjetiteljima povlačenje u bilo kojem trenutku."

#: admin/views/setup.php:109
msgid "Opt-out model: a \"Do Not Sell or Share\" link is added."
msgstr "Opt-out model: dodaje se poveznica „Ne prodaj niti dijeli“."

#: admin/views/setup.php:110
msgid "Consent is remembered for up to 365 days."
msgstr "Privola se pamti do 365 dana."

#: admin/views/setup.php:111
msgid "The notice shows the \"Do Not Sell or Share\" control instead of GDPR Accept and Reject controls."
msgstr "Obavijest prikazuje kontrolu „Ne prodaj niti dijeli“ umjesto GDPR kontrola Prihvati i Odbij."

#: admin/views/setup.php:114
msgid "Both (mixed EU + US audience)"
msgstr "Oboje (mješovita publika EU + SAD)"

#: admin/views/setup.php:115
msgid "For a site with both EU and US visitors. The more protective opt-in model governs the banner, so EU visitors are never downgraded — while the US \"Do Not Sell or Share\" opt-out link is still shown."
msgstr "Za stranicu s posjetiteljima i iz EU-a i iz SAD-a. Zaštitniji opt-in model upravlja bannerom, tako da posjetitelji iz EU-a nikada nisu degradirani — dok se poveznica opt-out „Ne prodaj niti dijeli“ za SAD i dalje prikazuje."

#: admin/views/setup.php:116
msgid "Opt-in model plus the US \"Do Not Sell or Share\" link."
msgstr "Opt-in model uz američku poveznicu „Ne prodaj niti dijeli“."

#: admin/views/setup.php:118
msgid "Equal-weight Accept and Reject buttons are shown, together with the US opt-out control."
msgstr "Prikazuju se gumbi Prihvati i Odbij jednake težine, zajedno s američkom opt-out kontrolom."

#: admin/views/setup.php:122
msgid "For visitors covered by South Africa's Protection of Personal Information Act. This conservative preset uses voluntary, specific and informed consent under section 11(1)(a) for non-essential cookies. POPIA also permits other lawful justifications under section 11(1)(b)-(f), which must be assessed and documented separately."
msgstr "Za posjetitelje obuhvaćene južnoafričkim Zakonom o zaštiti osobnih podataka. Ova konzervativna zadana postavka koristi dobrovoljnu, specifičnu i informiranu privolu prema section 11(1)(a) za nenužne kolačiće. POPIA također dopušta druge zakonite osnove prema section 11(1)(b)-(f), koje se moraju zasebno procijeniti i dokumentirati."

#: admin/views/setup.php:123
msgid "Consent-based preset: non-essential cookies stay blocked until consent."
msgstr "Zadana postavka temeljena na privoli: nenužni kolačići ostaju blokirani do davanja privole."

#: admin/views/setup.php:144
msgid "Per-service consent toggles"
msgstr "Prekidači privole po pojedinačnoj usluzi"

#: admin/views/setup.php:145
msgid "Let visitors accept or reject each detected service (YouTube, Google Analytics, …) individually inside the preference center, in addition to whole categories."
msgstr "Omogućite posjetiteljima da pojedinačno prihvate ili odbiju svaku otkrivenu uslugu (YouTube, Google Analytics, …) unutar centra postavki, uz cijele kategorije."

#: admin/views/setup.php:148
msgid "Google Tag Manager dataLayer events"
msgstr "Google Tag Manager dataLayer događaji"

#: admin/views/setup.php:149
msgid "Push consent choices to the GTM dataLayer so tags can react to consent without custom code."
msgstr "Šaljite izbore privole u GTM dataLayer kako bi oznake mogle reagirati na privolu bez prilagođenog koda."

#: admin/views/setup.php:152
msgid "Hide the banner from bots and crawlers"
msgstr "Sakrij banner od botova i tražilica"

#: admin/views/setup.php:153
msgid "Search engines and performance tools see the page without the banner. Recommended: keeps audits clean and has no effect on real visitors."
msgstr "Tražilice i alati za mjerenje performansi vide stranicu bez bannera. Preporučeno: revizije ostaju čiste i nema utjecaja na stvarne posjetitelje."

#: admin/views/setup.php:156
msgid "Cache Compatibility Mode"
msgstr "Način kompatibilnosti s predmemorijom"

#: admin/views/setup.php:157
msgid "Keeps one visitor-invariant page when jurisdiction enforcement is off and the active banner law applies to everyone. For compliant per-country enforcement with a page cache, use the cache-safe jurisdiction bootstrap in step 6."
msgstr "Zadržava jednu stranicu jednaku za sve posjetitelje kada je provedba nadležnosti isključena i zakon aktivnog bannera vrijedi za sve. Za usklađenu provedbu po zemlji uz predmemoriju stranice upotrijebite bootstrap nadležnosti siguran za predmemoriju u 6. koraku."

#: admin/views/setup.php:160
msgid "Ad-blocker banner resilience"
msgstr "Otpornost bannera na blokatore oglasa"

#: admin/views/setup.php:161
msgid "Re-asserts the legally required consent banner if an ad-block cosmetic filter hides it. It never blocks content and never forces interaction."
msgstr "Ponovno potvrđuje zakonski obavezan banner za privolu ako ga kozmetički filtar blokatora oglasa sakrije. Nikada ne blokira sadržaj i nikada ne prisiljava interakciju."

#: admin/views/setup.php:181 admin/views/setup.php:425
msgid "Applicable law"
msgstr "Primjenjiva regulativa"

#: admin/views/setup.php:183 admin/views/setup.php:255
msgid "Banner options"
msgstr "Opcije bannera"

#: admin/views/setup.php:184
msgid "Consent Mode"
msgstr "Način privole"

#: admin/views/setup.php:186
msgid "Jurisdiction routing"
msgstr "Usmjeravanje nadležnosti"

#: admin/views/setup.php:187
msgid "Find cookies"
msgstr "Pronađi kolačiće"

#: admin/views/setup.php:188 admin/views/setup.php:421
msgid "Review & finish"
msgstr "Pregledaj i dovrši"

#: admin/views/setup.php:193
msgid "Setup steps"
msgstr "Koraci postavljanja"

#: admin/views/setup.php:207
msgid "Which privacy law applies to your visitors?"
msgstr "Koji zakon o privatnosti se primjenjuje na vaše posjetitelje?"

#: admin/views/setup.php:208
msgid "This sets a compliant baseline for your cookie banner. You can change every detail later on the Cookie Banner page."
msgstr "Ovo postavlja usklađenu osnovu za vaš banner za kolačiće. Svaki detalj možete kasnije promijeniti na stranici Banner za kolačiće."

#: admin/views/setup.php:211
msgid "Applicable privacy law"
msgstr "Primjenjivi zakon o privatnosti"

#: admin/views/setup.php:227 admin/views/setup.php:428
msgid "Banner language"
msgstr "Jezik bannera"

#: admin/views/setup.php:228
msgid "The default language your cookie banner is shown in. It is pre-selected from your site language."
msgstr "Zadani jezik na kojem se prikazuje vaš banner za kolačiće. Unaprijed je odabran prema jeziku vaše stranice."

#: admin/views/setup.php:231
msgid "Default banner language"
msgstr "Zadani jezik bannera"

#: admin/views/setup.php:233
msgid "Banner translation included"
msgstr "Uključen prijevod bannera"

#: admin/views/setup.php:238
msgid "Shown in English until you translate it"
msgstr "Prikazuje se na engleskom dok ga ne prevedete"

#: admin/views/setup.php:244
msgid "No banner translation ships for this language yet: visitors will see the banner in English until you translate its texts on the Languages page."
msgstr "Za ovaj jezik još nije isporučen prijevod bannera: posjetitelji će vidjeti banner na engleskom dok ne prevedete njegove tekstove na stranici Jezici."

#: admin/views/setup.php:248
msgid "Additional languages, automatic visitor-language detection and per-language banner texts are managed on the Languages page afterwards."
msgstr "Dodatni jezici, automatsko otkrivanje jezika posjetitelja i tekstovi bannera po jeziku naknadno se upravljaju na stranici Jezici."

#: admin/views/setup.php:249
msgid "Open the Languages page"
msgstr "Otvori stranicu Jezici"

#: admin/views/setup.php:255 admin/views/setup.php:283
#: admin/views/setup.php:317 admin/views/setup.php:390
msgid "(optional)"
msgstr "(neobavezno)"

#: admin/views/setup.php:256
msgid "The most useful banner switches. Everything here can be changed later under Settings → Banner Control."
msgstr "Najkorisniji prekidači bannera. Sve ovdje se kasnije može promijeniti pod Postavke → Kontrola bannera."

#: admin/views/setup.php:268
msgid "Unavailable while jurisdiction enforcement is active. Use the cache-safe jurisdiction bootstrap in step 6 to keep compatible pages cacheable without applying one country's consent model to another."
msgstr "Nedostupno dok je provedba nadležnosti aktivna. U 6. koraku upotrijebite bootstrap nadležnosti siguran za predmemoriju kako bi kompatibilne stranice ostale spremne za predmemoriju bez primjene modela privole jedne zemlje na drugu."

#: admin/views/setup.php:278
msgid "With Cache Compatibility Mode on, the bot-skip is bypassed: cached pages must stay identical for every visitor, so bots receive the banner too."
msgstr "Kada je uključen Način kompatibilnosti s predmemorijom, preskakanje robota se zaobilazi: predmemorirane stranice moraju ostati identične za svakog posjetitelja, pa i roboti primaju banner."

#: admin/views/setup.php:283
msgid "Consent Mode signals"
msgstr "Signali Načina privole"

#: admin/views/setup.php:284
msgid "Consent Mode tells Google and Microsoft tags what the visitor allowed, before any of their cookies are set. Turn it on if you use Google Analytics, Google Ads, Tag Manager, Bing UET or Clarity."
msgstr "Način privole govori Google i Microsoft oznakama što je posjetitelj dopustio, prije nego što se postavi bilo koji njihov kolačić. Uključite ga ako koristite Google Analytics, Google Ads, Tag Manager, Bing UET ili Clarity."

#: admin/views/setup.php:293
msgid "Sends the standard consent signals (ad_storage, analytics_storage, …). Every signal starts as denied and is upgraded only after the visitor consents."
msgstr "Šalje standardne signale privole (ad_storage, analytics_storage, …). Svaki signal počinje kao odbijen i nadograđuje se tek nakon što posjetitelj da privolu."

#: admin/views/setup.php:299
msgid "Microsoft UET consent mode"
msgstr "Način privole za Microsoft UET"

#: admin/views/setup.php:300
msgid "Sends consent signals to the Bing / Microsoft Advertising UET tag."
msgstr "Šalje signale privole oznaci Bing / Microsoft Advertising UET."

#: admin/views/setup.php:306
msgid "Microsoft Clarity consent"
msgstr "Privola za Microsoft Clarity"

#: admin/views/setup.php:307
msgid "Gates Microsoft Clarity session recording behind the visitor's consent."
msgstr "Uvjetuje snimanje sesija putem Microsoft Clarityja privolom posjetitelja."

#: admin/views/setup.php:312
msgid "Fine-tuning (region-specific defaults, URL passthrough, advanced mode) lives on the Google Consent Mode page."
msgstr "Fino podešavanje (zadane postavke specifične za regiju, prosljeđivanje URL-a, napredni način) nalazi se na stranici Google način pristanka."

#: admin/views/setup.php:317
msgid "IAB TCF framework"
msgstr "IAB TCF okvir"

#: admin/views/setup.php:318
msgid "Only for publishers who serve ads through vendors that require the IAB Transparency & Consent Framework (e.g. AdSense / Ad Manager in the EEA). It requires a CMP ID registered with IAB Europe — without one, leave this off."
msgstr "Samo za izdavače koji poslužuju oglase putem dobavljača koji zahtijevaju IAB Transparency & Consent Framework (npr. AdSense / Ad Manager u EGP-u). Zahtijeva CMP ID registriran kod IAB Europe — bez njega, ostavite ovo isključenim."

#: admin/views/setup.php:324
msgid "Enable IAB TCF v2.3 support"
msgstr "Omogući podršku za IAB TCF v2.3"

#: admin/views/setup.php:325
msgid "Adds the TC string and the __tcfapi interface the ad vendors read."
msgstr "Dodaje TC string i __tcfapi sučelje koje čitaju dobavljači oglasa."

#: admin/views/setup.php:333
msgid "e.g. 300"
msgstr "npr. 300"

#: admin/views/setup.php:336
msgid "Publisher country (2 letters)"
msgstr "Država izdavača (2 slova)"

#: admin/views/setup.php:340
msgid "Enter your registered CMP ID (between 2 and 4095) to enable IAB TCF, or turn the toggle off."
msgstr "Unesite svoj registrirani CMP ID (između 2 i 4095) kako biste omogućili IAB TCF, ili isključite prekidač."

#: admin/views/setup.php:341
msgid "The publisher country must be a 2-letter code (e.g. IT, DE), or leave it empty."
msgstr "Država izdavača mora biti dvoslovna oznaka (npr. IT, DE), ili je ostavite praznom."

#: admin/views/setup.php:346
msgid "Jurisdiction rules and geo-routing"
msgstr "Pravila nadležnosti i geo-usmjeravanje"

#: admin/views/setup.php:347
msgid "Apply the correct consent defaults and mandatory controls for each visitor's country. Enforcement is enabled by default; banner visibility outside selected regions is a separate choice below."
msgstr "Primjenjuje ispravne zadane vrijednosti privole i obvezne kontrole za zemlju svakog posjetitelja. Provedba je uključena prema zadanim postavkama; vidljivost bannera izvan odabranih regija zaseban je odabir u nastavku."

#: admin/views/setup.php:353
msgid "Apply jurisdiction rules by visitor location (recommended)"
msgstr "Primijeni pravila nadležnosti prema lokaciji posjetitelja (preporučeno)"

#: admin/views/setup.php:354
msgid "Turning this off makes the law saved on the active banner apply to every visitor. For example, a CCPA banner will no longer gain GDPR blocking for an EEA visitor."
msgstr "Isključivanje znači da se zakon spremljen u aktivnom banneru primjenjuje na svakog posjetitelja. Primjerice, CCPA banner više neće dobiti GDPR blokiranje za posjetitelja iz EGP-a."

#: admin/views/setup.php:361
msgid "Recommended when a page cache or CDN is present. Compatible pages share one strict GDPR shell and resolve the live jurisdiction before the banner mounts or optional scripts run. Unsupported configurations remain protected and bypass the page cache."
msgstr "Preporučeno kada postoji predmemorija stranice ili CDN. Kompatibilne stranice dijele jednu strogu GDPR ljusku i određuju stvarnu nadležnost prije postavljanja bannera ili pokretanja neobaveznih skripti. Nepodržane konfiguracije ostaju zaštićene i zaobilaze predmemoriju stranice."

#: admin/views/setup.php:368
msgid "Regions that see the banner"
msgstr "Regije koje vide banner"

#: admin/views/setup.php:379
msgid "Visitors from other regions"
msgstr "Posjetitelji iz drugih regija"

#: admin/views/setup.php:381
msgid "Still show the banner (safest)"
msgstr "I dalje prikaži banner (najsigurnije)"

#: admin/views/setup.php:382
msgid "Hide the banner and allow cookies"
msgstr "Sakrij banner i dopusti kolačiće"

#: admin/views/setup.php:390
msgid "Find your cookies"
msgstr "Pronađite svoje kolačiće"

#: admin/views/setup.php:391
msgid "A scan visits a sample of your pages in the background of this tab and loads them the way a visitor would, so it sees the cookies your scripts actually set — including the ones written by analytics, advertising and embedded players. It is optional, and you can always run it later from the Cookies page. Keep this tab open while it runs."
msgstr "Skeniranje posjećuje uzorak vaših stranica u pozadini ove kartice i učitava ih na način na koji bi to učinio posjetitelj, pa vidi kolačiće koje vaše skripte doista postavljaju — uključujući one koje pišu analitika, oglašavanje i ugrađeni playeri. Neobavezno je i uvijek ga možete kasnije pokrenuti sa stranice Kolačići. Ostavite ovu karticu otvorenom dok se izvodi."

#: admin/views/setup.php:396
msgid "Run a quick scan"
msgstr "Pokreni brzo skeniranje"

#: admin/views/setup.php:398
msgid "Scan progress"
msgstr "Napredak skeniranja"

#: admin/views/setup.php:405
msgid "This scan covers a sample of your pages. To scan the whole site, or to re-scan after adding a service,"
msgstr "Ovo skeniranje pokriva uzorak vaših stranica. Za skeniranje cijele stranice, ili za ponovno skeniranje nakon dodavanja usluge,"

#: admin/views/setup.php:406
msgid "use the Cookies page"
msgstr "koristite stranicu Kolačići"

#: admin/views/setup.php:412
msgid "Payment services detected"
msgstr "Otkrivene usluge plaćanja"

#: admin/views/setup.php:413
msgid "These payment providers were detected on your site. Ticking one always allows its scripts and cookies — payment SDKs are strictly necessary for checkout, but enable this only where payments genuinely happen outside a WooCommerce checkout."
msgstr "Ovi pružatelji usluga plaćanja otkriveni su na vašoj stranici. Označavanje jednog uvijek dopušta njegove skripte i kolačiće — SDK-ovi za plaćanje strogo su nužni za naplatu, ali ovo omogućite samo tamo gdje se plaćanja doista odvijaju izvan WooCommerce naplate."

#: admin/views/setup.php:414
msgid "WooCommerce checkout and cart pages already allow payment scripts automatically — no opt-in needed for those pages."
msgstr "Stranice WooCommerce naplate i košarice već automatski dopuštaju skripte za plaćanje — za te stranice nije potreban opt-in."

#: admin/views/setup.php:422
msgid "Here is what will be applied. These are compliant defaults — the controls match the selected consent model and no categories are pre-ticked."
msgstr "Evo što će se primijeniti. Ovo su usklađene zadane postavke — kontrole odgovaraju odabranom modelu privole i nijedna kategorija nije unaprijed označena."

#: admin/views/setup.php:426
msgid "Consent model"
msgstr "Model privole"

#: admin/views/setup.php:427
msgid "Consent expiry"
msgstr "Istek privole"

