#: includes/class-cli.php:429
msgid "Cookie Consent (FAZ Cookie Manager)"
msgstr "Privola za kolačiće (FAZ Cookie Manager)"

#: includes/class-cli.php:430
msgid "This site uses the FAZ Cookie Manager plugin to collect and manage cookie consent. When you interact with the cookie banner, we record your consent choice (accepted, rejected, or partial), a hashed version of your IP address, your browser user agent, and the page URL where consent was given. This data is stored locally on our server and retained for the period configured in the plugin settings (default: 12 months)."
msgstr "Ova stranica koristi plugin FAZ Cookie Manager za prikupljanje i upravljanje privolama za kolačiće. Kada koristite banner za kolačiće, bilježimo vaš odabir privole (prihvaćeno, odbijeno ili djelomično), hashiranu verziju vaše IP adrese, korisnički agent vašeg preglednika i URL stranice na kojoj je privola dana. Ti se podaci pohranjuju lokalno na našem poslužitelju i čuvaju tijekom razdoblja konfiguriranog u postavkama plugina (zadano: 12 mjeseci)."

#: includes/class-cli.php:431
msgid "You can change your cookie preferences at any time using the cookie icon in the bottom corner of the page."
msgstr "Svoje postavke kolačića možete promijeniti u bilo kojem trenutku pomoću ikone kolačića u donjem kutu stranice."

#: includes/class-cli.php:444 includes/class-cli.php:453
msgid "FAZ Cookie Manager — Consent Logs & Privacy Requests"
msgstr "FAZ Cookie Manager — zapisi privola i zahtjevi za privatnost"

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:69
msgid "What Are Cookies"
msgstr "Što su kolačići"

#. translators: %s: site name
#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:72
#, php-format
msgid "Cookies are small text files that are placed on your device when you visit %s. They are widely used to make websites work more efficiently, as well as to provide information to the website owners."
msgstr "Kolačići su male tekstualne datoteke koje se postavljaju na vaš uređaj kada posjetite %s. Široko se koriste kako bi web-stranice radile učinkovitije, kao i za pružanje informacija vlasnicima web-stranica."

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:75
msgid "How We Use Cookies"
msgstr "Kako koristimo kolačiće"

#. translators: %s: site name
#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:78
#, php-format
msgid "%s uses cookies for several purposes, including:"
msgstr "%s koristi kolačiće u nekoliko svrha, uključujući:"

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:81
msgid "Necessary cookies"
msgstr "Nužni kolačići"

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:81
msgid "These cookies are essential for the website to function properly. They enable basic functions like page navigation, access to secure areas, and shopping cart functionality. The website cannot function properly without these cookies."
msgstr "Ovi kolačići nužni su za ispravno funkcioniranje web-stranice. Omogućuju osnovne funkcije poput navigacije stranicom, pristupa sigurnim područjima i funkcionalnosti košarice. Web-stranica ne može ispravno funkcionirati bez ovih kolačića."

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:82
msgid "Functional cookies"
msgstr "Funkcionalni kolačići"

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:82
msgid "These cookies enable the website to remember choices you make (such as your language preference or region) and provide enhanced, more personalised features."
msgstr "Ovi kolačići omogućuju web-stranici da zapamti vaše odabire (poput jezične postavke ili regije) i pruži poboljšane, personaliziranije značajke."

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:83
msgid "Analytics cookies"
msgstr "Analitički kolačići"

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:83
msgid "These cookies help us understand how visitors interact with the website by collecting and reporting information anonymously. This helps us improve the website and your experience."
msgstr "Ovi kolačići pomažu nam razumjeti kako posjetitelji koriste web-stranicu prikupljanjem i anonimnim izvještavanjem informacija. To nam pomaže poboljšati web-stranicu i vaše iskustvo."

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:84
msgid "Marketing cookies"
msgstr "Marketinški kolačići"

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:84
msgid "These cookies are used to deliver advertisements that are relevant to you and your interests. They are also used to limit the number of times you see an advertisement and help measure the effectiveness of advertising campaigns."
msgstr "Ovi kolačići koriste se za prikazivanje oglasa koji su relevantni za vas i vaše interese. Također se koriste za ograničavanje broja prikazivanja oglasa i mjerenje učinkovitosti oglasnih kampanja."

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:88
msgid "Cookies We Use"
msgstr "Kolačići koje koristimo"

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:89
msgid "The table below lists the cookies used on this website, along with their purpose, duration, and category."
msgstr "Tablica u nastavku navodi kolačiće koji se koriste na ovoj web-stranici, zajedno s njihovom svrhom, trajanjem i kategorijom."

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:93
msgid "How to Manage Cookies"
msgstr "Kako upravljati kolačićima"

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:94
msgid "You can manage your cookie preferences at any time by clicking the cookie icon in the bottom corner of the page, or by using the button below."
msgstr "Svojim postavkama kolačića možete upravljati u bilo kojem trenutku klikom na ikonu kolačića u donjem kutu stranice ili pomoću gumba u nastavku."

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:96
msgid "You can also control cookies through your browser settings. Most browsers allow you to:"
msgstr "Kolačićima možete upravljati i putem postavki preglednika. Većina preglednika omogućuje vam da:"

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:98
msgid "View what cookies are stored and delete them individually"
msgstr "Pregledate koji su kolačići pohranjeni i pojedinačno ih obrišete"

#: includes/class-cookie-policy-shortcode.php:99
